WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.520
The orbicularis oris is a muscle
that wraps completely around the

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.520
lips.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.660
It is a sphincter muscle that
also works as a depressor muscle.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.940
When we pucker our lips, we
activate our mentalis muscle.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.200
As we activate that muscle, not
only can we see the dimpling of

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.020
the muscle under the skin, but we
can also see the uplifting action

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.880
of that mentalis muscle.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:41.840
We also have the DAOs, which are
a depressor muscle that pulls the

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.560
corner of our mouth downwards.
